  "body": "The DataForSEO blocks are missing the required error output pin. Meaning that errors cannot be handled by agents filled with these blocks.<br><br>[https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/AutoGPT/blob/master/autogpt_platform/backend/backend/blocks/dataforseo/related_keywords.py](https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/AutoGPT/blob/master/autogpt_platform/backend/backend/blocks/dataforseo/related_keywords.py)<br><br>[https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/AutoGPT/blob/master/autogpt_platform/backend/backend/blocks/dataforseo/keyword_suggestions.py](https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/AutoGPT/blob/master/autogpt_platform/backend/backend/blocks/dataforseo/keyword_suggestions.py)<br><br>In order to complete this ticket, all you need to do is add output pins called 'error' to each of the above blocks and yield any errors that occur during the block's execution to them.",
